      "sourceTextSha256": "34d3622dfeb5e9eee73e9e3a828d919bea3c8374a4157aa14124795ec7da9c18",
      "text": "Day 2 · Breakfast, then a 4-hour city tour and Sugar Loaf excursion with an English-speaking guide: the cable car from Praia Vermelha to Morro da Urca and the summit of Sugar Loaf, with views of Copacabana, the bay, the islands, the Niterói Bridge and Christ the Redeemer, then old Rio, with its historic churches, monasteries, cathedral and colonial buildings (the route may be adjusted because of Carnival road closures). In the evening, the Parade of Champions at the Sambadrome: the winning samba schools of Carnival 2027 parade once more in all their splendour. Return to the hotel whenever you wish.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1p43mEGxeh35l0VLkcj1IlUV9E-hKpInp",
        "documentSha256": "3fee51854bf61a45547d1df8df4f548db569100525537afde1e341551188fbdf",
