      "sourceTextSha256": "8826bf162edf5841aacb331ab57cf998934f3caf242c88784aac54a8d4ba8937",
      "text": "Day 3 · Breakfast, then a 4-hour excursion to Corcovado with an English-speaking guide: the open train climbs through the Tijuca Forest to the statue of Christ the Redeemer (38 m), at about 710 m, inaugurated in 1931, overlooking the Rio–Niterói Bridge, Guanabara Bay, the Botanical Garden, the Maracanã Stadium and Sugar Loaf.",
